--- !u!114 &524688652
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 524688650}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: UnityEngine.UI::UnityEngine.UI.Text
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0.9, g: 0.95, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
    m_FontSize: 13
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 10
    m_MaxSize: 40
    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.25
  m_Text: "<color=#00E5FF><b>1. DI CHUY\u1EC2N C\u01A0 B\u1EA2N:</b></color>\n \u2022
    <color=#FFDD44>[W, A, S, D]</color>: Di chuy\u1EC3n sinh vi\xEAn (Gi\u1EEF ph\xEDm
    \u0111\u1EC3 Ch\u1EA1y Nhanh Sprint)\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[Space]</color>:
    Nh\u1EA3y qua ch\u01B0\u1EDBng ng\u1EA1i v\u1EADt\n\n<color=#00E5FF><b>2. CHI\u1EBEN
    \u0110\u1EA4U & N\xC9M BOM H\u1EB8N GI\u1EDC:</b></color>\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[G]</color>:
    <b>N\xC9M BOM H\u1EB8N GI\u1EDC (N\u1ED4 SAU 4S)</b> - S\xF3ng xung k\xEDch &
    b\u1ED9c ph\xE1 c\u1EF1c \u0111\u1EB9p!\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[Chu\u1ED9t Ph\u1EA3i
    (Gi\u1EEF)]</color>: <b>Ng\u1EAFm B\u1EAFn Cao X\u1EA1 ADS (Zoom)</b> - T\u1EF1
    \u0111\u1ED9ng kh\xF3a Phi C\u01A1 tr\xEAn tr\u1EDDi!\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[Q]</color>:
    <b>Ph\xF3ng T\xEAn L\u1EEDa Ph\xF2ng Kh\xF4ng T\u1EA7m Nhi\u1EC7t</b> (T\u1EF1
    \u0111u\u1ED5i v\xE0 di\u1EC7t qu\xE1i v\u1EADt bay)\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[Chu\u1ED9t
    Tr\xE1i / F]</color>: B\u1EAFn \u0111\u1EA1n Plasma th\u1EADt (ho\u1EB7c tung
    c\xFA \u0111\u1EA5m combo)\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[V]</color>: Tung c\xFA \u0111\u1EA5m
    c\u1EADn chi\u1EBFn nhanh b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 l\xFAc n\xE0o\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[X
    / Tab]</color>: Chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED5i gi\u1EEFa <b>S\xFAng Cyber Plasma</b>
    \u2194 <b>\u0110\xE1nh Tay Kh\xF4ng</b>\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[1, 2, 3]</color>:
    Tuy\u1EC7t chi\xEAu (<b>[1]</b> EMP | <b>[2]</b> B\xE3o Laser | <b>[3]</b> Kh\xF4ng
    K\xEDch)\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[K]</color>: <b>Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i t\u1EE9c
    th\xEC Phi C\u01A1 Qu\xE1i V\u1EADt</b> tr\xEAn b\u1EA7u tr\u1EDDi \u0111\u1EC3
    th\u1EED s\u1EE9c ng\u1EAFm b\u1EAFn!\n\n<color=#00E5FF><b>3. H\xD2M TI\u1EBEP
    T\u1EBE C\u1EE8U TH\u01AF\u01A0NG T\u1EEA DRONE:</b></color>\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[T]</color>:
    <b>G\u1ECDi Drone th\u1EA3 H\xF2m Ti\u1EBFp T\u1EBF C\u1EE9u Th\u01B0\u01A1ng</b>
    (H\u1ED3i 100% m\xE1u & gi\xE1p)\n \u2022 <i>Khi b\u1EA1n s\u1EAFp h\u1EBFt m\xE1u
    (\u2264 35%) ho\u1EB7c b\u1ECB s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\xED m\u1EA1ng, Drone
    s\u1EBD <b>T\u1EF0 \u0110\u1ED8NG TH\u1EA2 H\xD2M H\u1ED2I SINH</b> c\u1EE9u
    nguy ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c!</i>\n\n<color=#00E5FF><b>4. TR\xD2 CH\u01A0I X\u1EBEP
    H\xCCNH CANDY CRUSH & KHU\xD4N VI\xCAN:</b></color>\n \u2022 \u0110\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n
    5 qu\xE1i v\u1EADt c\u0169 trong s\xE2n tr\u01B0\u1EDDng & nh\u1EA5n <b>[E]</b>
    \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u01A1i x\u1EBFp h\xECnh Match-3.\n \u2022 <b>X\u1EBFp 5 vi\xEAn
    m\u1ED9t h\xE0ng</b> \u0111\u1EC3 k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t <b>SI\xCAU BOM N\u1ED4 LAN</b>
    (Color Bomb n\u1ED5 tung c\u1EA3 b\xE0n c\u1EDD)!\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[N]</color>:
    M\u1EDF Album \u1EA3nh k\u1EF7 ni\u1EC7m IUH  |  <color=#FFDD44>[U]</color>:
    L\xE1i Drone tu\u1EA7n tra\n \u2022 <color=#FFDD44>[B]</color>: M\u1EDF Kho \u0111\u1ED3
    & N\xE2ng c\u1EA5p  |  <color=#FFDD44>[H / ESC]</color>: \u0110\xF3ng / M\u1EDF
    b\u1EA3ng n\xE0y"
